{"v":4,"catch":"太空恐慌！ 通過對接團結飛機並加電以擊敗敵人！","desc":"“ MOON CRESTA”是由Nichibutsu在1980年製作和發行的射擊遊戲。\n  玩家控制飛機的Unit1，Unit 2和Unit3，並合併這些飛機，將擊敗敵人。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-02-06","genres":["其他","街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b7de2c3ad1cdb8630795cb8c8c3f0104ec73b7b508199cda47ec15ca781c2488.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/68f67d8203c5d34a908a498750717f5e6f2bf53ff177b927c5eb488438e52da0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0fae622e7aea59114fcb29017183738d3f8953b980d565d785a9317339e92d50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6f01c1e54131923144a347ab748e74bbc45609f84f7cf7b92b39d57f6fcce14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c17b735d45b4f3124da082ea204e24b2e49592987de96e318c20925027decc8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff4270fd8acf28c5a07fb2292a52024fd438ecd7f44b3a36f6a1b2673c0ff300.jpg"],"titleId":"01000be001dd8000","dlc":[]}